<title>USA: Fedders Corp fiscal 1996 sales $370 mln.</title>
<headline>Fedders Corp fiscal 1996 sales $370 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fedders Corp said on Monday that its sales for the fiscal year ended August 31, 1996 were $370 million, an estimated increase of 17 percent over prior year sales of $316.5 million.</p>
<p>As a result of strong cash flow, Fedders ended fiscal 1996 with a strong cash balance of approximately $90 million, up from $57 million the prior year.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
